<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>’Tis our dear Lord we wait for,</l><l>Our Hope! our Joy! our Friend!</l><l>Himself we long to welcome,</l><l>And just beyond the bend</l><l>Hidden, perchance to meet us</l><l>Before the day is done,</l><l>The waiting will be over</l><l>And rest will have begun.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
